  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the scene of urgent bodily need while being spoken to",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene described in the meme, where they identify with the experience of being interrupted or having to urgently attend to a bodily need while engaged in a conversation. This projection is facilitated by the text 'when someone is talkin to you and you gotta shit', which uses second-person address ('you') to directly involve the viewer in the scenario. The user sees themselves in the situation, and the visual material (Oprah Winfrey's frustrated expression) serves as a relatable emotional anchor for this projection. The projection is not onto a specific visual or textual element alone, but onto the entire scene (urgent_bodily_need_scene) which combines both text and visual material to create a shared, relatable experience.",
  "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface",
